* monitors (VCVS, no load) for nets the .meas lines cannot index directly
Eq0 q0m 0 Q[0] 0 1
Ewl wl45m 0 WL[45] 0 1
Ecq cq 0 xs[0].xa0.q[45] 0 1
Ecqb cqb 0 xs[0].xa0.qb[45] 0 1
